032"], "target_head": "t032"}, {"id": "HOS.3.3.a020", "note": "", "source": ["WLC.HOS.3.3.021"], "source_head": "WLC.HOS.3.3.021", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t033"], "target_head": "t033"}], "ref": "HOS.3.3", "review_notes": ["The idiomatic marital phrase לְאִישׁ was treated as noncompositional with “any man’s wife”; the competing compositional-plus-added analysis is recorded in that unit’s note."], "source_edition": "ASV-alignment Hebrew projection", "target_edition": "ASV", "variant_decisions": []}
